        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-067293",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we engage external contractors to supplement our team in software and firmware development, digital design, test development, and product-level testing.",
        "start_character": 9212,
        "end_character": 9377
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-067293",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-067293-ce87d478db3f3451",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-067293",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The rapid rate of technological change in our industry could increase the likelihood that we will face competition from new products or services designed by companies with whom we do not currently compete.",
        "start_character": 7420,
        "end_character": 7625
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-067293",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-067293-ce87d478db3f3451",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-067293",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We face competition in each of the sectors in which we operate, but there is no single company that provides a similarly broad suite of solutions and competes across all of our business segments.",
        "start_character": 6840,
        "end_character": 7035
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-067293",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-067293-ce87d478db3f3451",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-067293",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For many international customers, we design, engineer, and maintain roadside photo enforcement technology, including both hardware and software, which is sold or licensed to government agencies and often maintained with maintenance contracts to support the technology.",
        "start_character": 5140,
        "end_character": 5408
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-067293",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-067293-ce87d478db3f3451",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-067293",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, our foreign photo enforcement programs are subject to regulation in the various countries in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 17292,
        "end_character": 17415
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-067293",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-067293-ce87d478db3f3451",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-067293",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Moreover, we face competition from our own customers as they may choose to invest in developing internal solutions.",
        "start_character": 7825,
        "end_character": 7940
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-067293",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-067293-ce87d478db3f3451",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-067293",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our violations management solution processes violations incurred by the drivers of RAC, Direct Fleet, and FMC vehicles by working with domestic violation-issuing authorities to pay fines on behalf of vehicle owners, for which we are able to bill individual drivers or transfer liability directly to vehicle drivers.",
        "start_character": 2532,
        "end_character": 2847
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-067293",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-067293-ce87d478db3f3451",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-067293",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The primary sectors in which we operate are automated safety, tolling, commercial fleet management, and parking.",
        "start_character": 6727,
        "end_character": 6839
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-067293",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-067293-ce87d478db3f3451",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-067293",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also develop our employees through an annual performance review and assessment process that incorporates a dual-performance rating system and provides each employee with concrete, actionable feedback to support professional development and performance improvement.",
        "start_character": 21034,
        "end_character": 21301
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-067293",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-067293-ce87d478db3f3451",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-067293",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also offer an end-to-end solution, in which we automatically send captured events to our customer’s designated enforcement agency, and, once a violation is confirmed, we manage citation mailing, billing, and other administrative tasks on behalf of the customer.",
        "start_character": 4702,
        "end_character": 4966
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-067293",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-067293-ce87d478db3f3451",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-067293",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are a leading provider of smart mobility technology solutions, principally operating throughout the United States, Australia, Europe, and Canada.",
        "start_character": 26,
        "end_character": 174
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-067293",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-067293-ce87d478db3f3451",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-067293",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We claim copyright on all internally-developed software.",
        "start_character": 12235,
        "end_character": 12291
      }
    ]
